        "created_at": "2017-08-24T18:32:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>She is missing the eyepatch in a couple of her incaps, but the eye under it is scarred, not freshly wounded.</p><p>I'm getting a little confused about what they consider spoilers. &nbsp;I'm going to come right out and say it, even though it was in the spoiler section of this episode, because it wasn't in the spoiler section of the Unity episode--that she and Benchmark are members of the new team \"The Paradigms,\" under the auspices of Revo-Corp. &nbsp;Are they now just tossing everything not already in the published Tactics products into the spoilers section?</p>",
