        "created_at": "2017-08-31T01:12:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I listen to the podcasts via a phone app, so I didn't see the show notes and art until now. &nbsp;The art is... interesting. &nbsp;It's a collage of the RevoCorp logo, Revenant, Benchmark and... some guy's crotch.</p>",
