        "created_at": "2017-08-31T01:28:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I listen to the podcasts via a phone app, so I didn't see the show notes and art until now. &nbsp;The art is… interesting. &nbsp;It's a collage of the RevoCorp logo, Revenant, Benchmark and… some guy's crotch.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think the focus is more on the symbol seen on the machine which isn't fully seen on Rebuilt to Survive</p>",
